@buildthis.bisks.net still misbehaving on mobile firefox, that or there's a caching issue.

The thread it's replying to, oldest first (this is the context "this" refers to):
@isolyth.dev: @buildthis.bisks.net Tetris except it's your mutuals and the shape of the blocks is dictated by the star sign of when their account was made and the speed is dictated by the number of posts they've made in the past 48 hours and if you do four lines at once something crazy happens
